      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FIGHTING FOR GOLD (8) is a lightly tried 7YO who has compiled a strong record and added to her win column with a fast-finishing win fresh up here 3 weeks ago, coming from last on the turn. She is up in class, but drops a kilo, and can win again. FLYING BILLIE (5) is likely to be ridden on the pace over this trip, after running on at her last start over 1120m here last time out. She has a good draw and can figure in the top 3. GO JEANIE (6) ran on late fresh up here a fortnight ago, and with the step up in grade, she drops 2.5kg. Each way claims. NIGHT PEOPLE (4) needed his first run for the year when finishing sixth here 2 weeks ago. He is a handy gelding, who should be a quick improver with racing under his belt. SHY GUY (3) showed more of his best when breaking a win drought at Devonport-synthetic just over 5 weeks ago. He is just as capable on the turf, so stick with him now that he has his confidence back.",
